+# Voice Greetings (Hindi + English)
+
+The app now **speaks a random greeting** every time it loads (refresh or starting
+the server), alternating between **Hindi** and **English** with premium
+AI-generated voices you chose during setup.
+
+## How to install (2 steps — this avoids Windows line-ending problems)
+
+**Step 1 — apply the code patch** (text-only, so it applies on Windows safely):
+
+```powershell
+git apply --whitespace=nowarn ui_voice_code.patch
+```
+
+**Step 2 — put the audio files in place** (they live in `voices.zip`, not the patch,
+because binary data breaks when a patch file is saved with Windows line endings):
+
+```powershell
+New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force -Path "frontend\public\voices"
+Expand-Archive -Path "voices.zip" -DestinationPath "frontend\public\voices" -Force
+```
+
+Final check — the folder must contain the 6 mp3s **directly** (no extra sub-folder):
+
+```
+frontend\public\voices\
+├── en-1.mp3   en-2.mp3   en-3.mp3
+├── hi-1.mp3   hi-2.mp3   hi-3.mp3
+```
+
+Then **hard-refresh (Ctrl+F5)** and you'll hear a random greeting (Hindi or English).
+
+## How it works
+
+- On every page load, the app picks **one clip at random** (50% Hindi, 50%
+  English, then one of 3 greetings in that language) and plays it.
+- 6 built-in clips in `frontend/public/voices/`:
+  - `hi-1.mp3`, `hi-2.mp3`, `hi-3.mp3` — Hindi (feminine voice)
+  - `en-1.mp3`, `en-2.mp3`, `en-3.mp3` — English / Indian accent (masculine voice)
+- **Autoplay handling:** browsers block sound until you interact with the page.
+  The greeting tries to play immediately; if blocked, it plays on your first
+  click/keypress. If the audio file is missing it falls back to the browser's
+  built-in speech synthesis — so it never breaks.
+- **Mute toggle:** a speaker button in the sidebar footer (below the theme toggle)
+  turns the voice off/on. Your choice is remembered (localStorage).
+
+## Files
+
+- `frontend/src/components/VoiceGreeting.jsx` *(new)* — playback logic + fallback.
+- `frontend/src/App.jsx` — integration, mute state, sidebar button.
+- `frontend/src/App.css` — button styles.
+- `frontend/public/voices/*.mp3` — the 6 greeting clips (from `voices.zip`).
+
+No backend changes.
+
+> Tip: use the sidebar **Voice on/off** button to mute if you don't want sound on
+> every refresh. The choice sticks.
+
